                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buck to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Buck reports that altogether about 22,000 men have been ordered to China by
                    the Japanese Government.)</p>
